<title>USA: Halis group cuts Morgan Financial stake.</title>
<headline>Halis group cuts Morgan Financial stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investor Jeffrey Halis said Friday it reduced its stake in Morgan Financial Corp to 2.68 percent or 22,398 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, thegroup said it sold 56,900 shares of Morgan on September 20 at $12 a share.</p>
<p>The shares were sold back to Morgan under an agreement between the group and the company signed on September 4, according to the filing.</p>
